<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-109.1-remodel-strategy-portfolio-planning-and-scope-definition" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W3473" name="W3473. Store Lifecycle &amp; Remodel Portfolio Strategy" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual capital &amp; store-lifecycle planning (links to VS-33.1/W26, VS-40)
Frequency: Annual + multi-year roadmap
Volume: ~200 stores in the lifecycle portfolio
Owner: VP Store Operations / Real Estate
Participants: VP Store Operations, Real Estate (links to VS-20/VS-97), Merchandising (links to VS-01), Finance/FP&amp;A (links to VS-17.4/VS-40), Strategy (links to VS-33)
Source: workflow W3473 — Store Lifecycle &amp; Remodel Portfolio Strategy</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3473_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3473_Lane1" name="VP Store Operations">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3473_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3473_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3473_Lane2" name="Real Estate">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3473_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3473_Lane3" name="COO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3473_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3473_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3473_Start5" name="Annual capital &amp; store-lifecycle planning (links to VS-33.1/W26, VS-40)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3473_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3473_Task6" name="VP Store Operations/Strategy set the store-lifecycle and remodel strategy…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: VP Store Operations/Strategy set the store-lifecycle and remodel strategy: target refresh cadence (5–7 yrs by format/age), format tiers (full remodel vs refresh vs re-fixture), category-expansion priorities (links to VS-01.1), market-repositioning rationale, and capex envelope vs the corporate capital plan (links to VS-40/VS-33.1); align to store-growth (links to VS-37) and closure (links to VS-59) plans
Responsible (R): VP Store Operations / Strategy
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3473_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3473_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3473_Task7" name="Real Estate/FP&amp;A build the multi-year remodel roadmap from the store-lifecycle…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Real Estate/FP&amp;A build the multi-year remodel roadmap from the store-lifecycle score (W3474): store age, sales trend, comp gap to market, fixture condition, customer-experience score (links to VS-13/VS-44), and capex affordability; sequence the ~30–40/year program against capacity, seasonality, and cash
Responsible (R): Real Estate / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3473_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3473_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3473_Task8" name="COO/CFO approve the remodel portfolio strategy and roadmap, confirm the capex…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: COO/CFO approve the remodel portfolio strategy and roadmap, confirm the capex allocation (links to VS-40) and the program governance (links to W3496/W112 PMO), and integrate to the annual plan (links to VS-33.1) and store-operations strategy
Responsible (R): COO / CFO
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3473_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3473_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3473_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3473_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3473_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-556 (ensure controlled execution — Remodel Strategy, Portfolio Planning &amp; Scope Definition (PA-109.1).) | - operational: lifecycle scoring (W3474); operational: portfolio governance and phasing
Owner: VP Store Operations / Real Estate</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3473_Assoc11" sourceRef="W3473_Annotation10" targetRef="W3473_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3473_Flow12" sourceRef="W3473_Start5" targetRef="W3473_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3473_Flow13" sourceRef="W3473_Task6" targetRef="W3473_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3473_Flow14" sourceRef="W3473_Task7" targetRef="W3473_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3473_Flow15" sourceRef="W3473_Task8" targetRef="W3473_End9" />
    </bpmn:process>
