    <bpmn:process id="W_W3477" name="W3477. Store Design, Layout &amp; Fixture Planning" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Business case approved (W3476); concept brief (W3475)
Frequency: Per remodel
Volume: ~30–40 designs/year
Owner: Store Design Lead
Participants: Store Design Lead, Merchandising/Space Planning (links to VS-55), Real Estate (links to VS-20), Facilities/MEP (links to VS-20.3), Store Manager
Source: workflow W3477 — Store Design, Layout &amp; Fixture Planning</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3477_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3477_Lane1" name="Store Design">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3477_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3477_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3477_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3477_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3477_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3477_Start3" name="Business case approved (W3476); concept brief (W3475)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3477_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3477_Task4" name="Store Design produce the detailed layout drawings: floor plan with…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Store Design produce the detailed layout drawings: floor plan with departments/zones, fixture plan and counts, aisle widths and ADA/accessibility compliance, checkout/service-counter layout (links to VS-08/VS-09), receiving/backroom reconfiguration (links to VS-07.3), and lumber-yard/outdoor area (links to W1281)
Responsible (R): Store Design / Space Planning
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: Per remodel</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3477_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3477_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3477_Task5" name="Store Design/Facilities coordinate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Store Design/Facilities coordinate MEP/HVAC/lighting/fire-protection/security/CCTV design (links to VS-20.3/VS-23), structural modifications, and technology infrastructure (data/power for POS links to VS-08, RFID/EAS links to VS-23, digital signage links to VS-75); ensure code compliance (links to VS-22)
Responsible (R): Store Design / Facilities / MEP
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: Per remodel</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3477_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3477_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3477_Task6" name="Store Design produce the FF&amp;E and signage package (fixture specs, finishes…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Store Design produce the FF&amp;E and signage package (fixture specs, finishes, department signage, wayfinding, brand graphics links to VS-14) and the planogram reset set (W3478); issue for procurement (W3481) and construction (W3483)
Responsible (R): Store Design
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: Per remodel</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3477_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3477_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3477_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3477_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
