    <bpmn:process id="W_W3478" name="W3478. Remodel Merchandising &amp; Assortment Reset Planning" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Layout/design (W3477); category strategy (links to VS-01)
Frequency: Per remodel
Volume: ~30–40 resets/year
Owner: Category Manager / Space Planner
Participants: Category Manager, Space Planner (links to VS-55), Merchandise Planner (links to VS-101), Store Manager (links to VS-07), Replenishment (links to VS-02)
Source: workflow W3478 — Remodel Merchandising &amp; Assortment Reset Planning</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3478_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3478_Lane1" name="Category Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3478_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3478_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3478_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3478_Lane2" name="Space Planner">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3478_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3478_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3478_Start4" name="Layout/design (W3477); category strategy (links to VS-01)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3478_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3478_Task5" name="Category Manager/Space Planner define the new assortment and space allocation…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Category Manager/Space Planner define the new assortment and space allocation per department: SKU adds/deletes/discontinuations (links to VS-01.1), linear/space share (links to VS-55/W2160), category roles, and adjacency/cross-merchandising; align to the trade-area profile (links to VS-33.3/VS-44)
Responsible (R): Category Mgr / Space Planner
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Per remodel</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3478_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3478_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3478_Task6" name="Space Planner produce the new planogram set for the remodel (links to VS-55)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Space Planner produce the new planogram set for the remodel (links to VS-55), fixture capacity check vs assortment, and the merchandise-reset sequence (W3487); Merchandise Planner plan the reset stock and clearance of displaced stock (links to VS-64/VS-05.3)
Responsible (R): Space Planner / Merch Planner
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Per remodel</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3478_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3478_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3478_Task7" name="Category Manager/Store Manager align the reset with pricing (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Category Manager/Store Manager align the reset with pricing (links to VS-01.2/W13), promotions (links to VS-58/VS-14), and labels/signage (W3485); brief the store on the new assortment and train staff (W3490); confirm the reset execution plan (W3487)
Responsible (R): Category Mgr / Store Manager
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Per remodel</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3478_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3478_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3478_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3478_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
