        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-556 (ensure controlled execution — Remodel Strategy, Portfolio Planning &amp; Scope Definition (PA-109.1).) | - operational: capacity check; operational: clearance planning (links to VS-64)
Owner: Category Manager / Space Planner</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
