    <bpmn:process id="W_W3480" name="W3480. Remodel Project Plan, Phasing &amp; Live-Operations Continuity" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Permits (W3479); design package (W3477)
Frequency: Per remodel
Volume: ~30–40 remodels/year
Owner: Project Manager / PMO
Participants: Project Manager (links to VS-112), Store Manager (links to VS-07), Contractor, Merchandising (links to VS-01), HSE (links to VS-24), Finance (links to VS-40), Maintenance &amp; Projects Coordinator
Source: workflow W3480 — Remodel Project Plan, Phasing &amp; Live-Operations Continuity</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3480_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3480_Lane1" name="Project Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3480_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3480_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3480_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3480_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3480_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3480_Start3" name="Permits (W3479); design package (W3477)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3480_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3480_Task4" name="Project Manager/PMO build the integrated project plan: WBS, schedule, phasing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Project Manager/PMO build the integrated project plan: WBS, schedule, phasing strategy (full-close vs phased/zone-by-zone vs after-hours), works sequence (demolition → structural → MEP → finishes → fixtures → tech → reset), and the critical path; set milestones, budget baseline (links to VS-40/W1814), and risk register (links to VS-112/W3558)
Responsible (R): Project Manager / PMO
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: Per remodel</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3480_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3480_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3480_Task5" name="Project Manager/Store Manager design the live-operations continuity plan…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Project Manager/Store Manager design the live-operations continuity plan: trading-area separation, dust/noise/safety barriers (links to VS-24), customer/stock flow, POS availability (links to VS-08), emergency egress, signage for customers, and the lost-sales estimate (W3476); align with Store Ops and Merchandising
Responsible (R): Project Manager / Store Manager
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: Per remodel</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3480_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3480_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3480_Task6" name="Project Manager establish site mobilization, contractor/site HSE (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Project Manager establish site mobilization, contractor/site HSE (links to VS-24), site coordination, daily/weekly cadence, change control (links to W3556), and reporting (links to VS-112); baseline the plan for performance tracking (W3493) and lessons (W3494)
Responsible (R): Project Manager / PMO
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Per remodel</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3480_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3480_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3480_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3480_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3480_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-556 (ensure controlled execution — Remodel Strategy, Portfolio Planning &amp; Scope Definition (PA-109.1).) | - operational: continuity planning and zone-by-zone execution; operational: integrated planning and milestone management
Owner: Project Manager / PMO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
